1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,349
在第一部分，container 只是把文件留在 bucket 里
In part 1, containers only left files in a bucket.

2
00:00:03,669 --> 00:00:06,589
这个 port toy 让两个 container 直接通信
Port toy makes two containers talk directly,

3
00:00:06,589 --> 00:00:09,908
而且只需要 Docker：一个 gateway 提供网页
and needs only Docker: a gateway serves a web page

4
00:00:09,908 --> 00:00:14,421
把你的文字转发给一个 processor，processor 再把它变成大写
and forwards your text to a processor, which turns it into capitals.

5
00:00:14,667 --> 00:00:17,827
把每个 container 想成一台独立的小电脑
Think of each container as its own little computer,

6
00:00:17,827 --> 00:00:21,110
有自己的 localhost，也有自己的一整套 port
with its own localhost and its own full set of ports.

7
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:25,739
两个 container 都可以用 port 9100，完全不会冲突
Two containers can both use port 9100 without any clash.

8
00:00:26,059 --> 00:00:28,999
这节课把这叫作网络命名空间
The lecture calls this a network namespace:

9
00:00:28,999 --> 00:00:32,075
每个 container 都是隔离的，直到你把它们连起来
each container is isolated until you wire it.

10
00:00:32,317 --> 00:00:35,935
你自己创建的网络把它们连起来，就像家里的小局域网
A network you create joins them like a small home network,

11
00:00:35,935 --> 00:00:39,677
还带一本电话簿，把 container 名变成地址
with a phone book that turns container names into addresses.

12
00:00:39,997 --> 00:00:42,109
Docker 的默认网络没有电话簿
Docker's default network has none.

13
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:43,513
先看 Prerequisites
Prerequisites:

14
00:00:43,513 --> 00:00:46,702
用 docker run hello-world 检查 Docker 有没有在运行
docker run hello-world checks that Docker is running.

15
00:00:47,022 --> 00:00:50,307
它会 pull 一个很小的 image，打印出 Hello from Docker
It pulls a tiny image and prints Hello from Docker!

16
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,790
第 1 步手动把应用搭起来
Step 1 sets the app up by hand.

17
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:55,834
在你的工作区目录里，把代码 clone 下来
From your workspace folder, clone the code:

18
00:00:55,834 --> 00:00:59,382
README 说 clone 或下载，却没给命令
the README says clone or download but prints no command.

19
00:00:59,702 --> 00:01:01,430
然后 cd 进 port toy 目录
Then cd into port toy.

20
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:03,200
暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
Pause and run them.

21
00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:06,713
两个额外检查：文件和 README 里的目录树一致
Two extra checks: the files match the README's tree,

22
00:01:06,713 --> 00:01:08,445
一个 gateway，一个 processor
a gateway and a processor,

23
00:01:08,445 --> 00:01:11,442
git log 显示这个视频 pin 住的 commit
and git log shows the commit this video pins.

24
00:01:11,683 --> 00:01:14,094
接下来：docker network create toynet
Next, docker network create toynet.

25
00:01:14,414 --> 00:01:16,590
Docker 打印出新网络的 ID
Docker prints the new network's ID:

26
00:01:16,590 --> 00:01:19,513
这就是两个 container 都要接上去的那根导轨
that's the rail both containers will plug into.

27
00:01:19,750 --> 00:01:21,918
从 README 的 Handy commands 里拿一条
From the README's handy commands,

28
00:01:21,918 --> 00:01:23,693
docker network ls 把它列出来
docker network ls lists it,

29
00:01:23,693 --> 00:01:26,321
旁边是 Docker 的三个内置网络
beside Docker's three built-in networks.

30
00:01:26,641 --> 00:01:28,241
暂停一下，创建你自己的网络
Pause, and create yours.

31
00:01:29,267 --> 00:01:30,974
接下来，构建两个 image
Next, build two images.

32
00:01:31,294 --> 00:01:34,741
两个 Dockerfile 几乎一模一样
The two Dockerfiles are almost identical:

33
00:01:34,741 --> 00:01:38,526
一个精简版的 Python 3.14 image，再从 apt 装上 curl
a slim Python 3.14 image, plus curl from apt.

34
00:01:38,846 --> 00:01:41,564
每个都把自己的代码复制进去，用 -u 运行
Each copies its code and runs it with -u,

35
00:01:41,564 --> 00:01:43,752
这样打印的内容会马上进到日志里
so prints reach the logs at once.

36
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,797
先构建的是 processor，它的 apt 那一层要花几秒钟
The processor builds first, and its apt layer takes a few seconds.

37
00:01:48,117 --> 00:01:51,318
你第一次构建时，还会 pull Python 的 base image
Your first build also pulls the Python base image.

38
00:01:51,567 --> 00:01:52,695
然后是 gateway
Then the gateway:

39
00:01:52,695 --> 00:01:56,302
Docker 从缓存里复用了 processor 的 apt 那一层
Docker reuses the processor's apt layer from the cache,

40
00:01:56,302 --> 00:01:59,460
因为两个文件在 COPY 那一行之前都一样
because the two files match up to the copy line.

41
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:01,380
不到 1 秒就构建完了
It's done in under a second.

42
00:02:02,367 --> 00:02:08,148
然后在 toynet 上启动 processor，PORT 设为 9200，不加 -p
Then start the processor on toynet, with PORT set to 9200, and no -p.

43
00:02:08,468 --> 00:02:14,335
它在自己的盒子里监听 9200，但你笔记本上没有任何东西通向它
It listens on 9200 inside its own box, but nothing on your laptop leads to it.

44
00:02:14,584 --> 00:02:16,184
然后启动 gateway
Then start the gateway.

45
00:02:16,312 --> 00:02:20,481
这里的 -p 会发布一个 port：它在你笔记本上开一扇临街的门
-p publishes a port: it opens a street door on your laptop

46
00:02:20,481 --> 00:02:23,501
通向 container 里面的一个房间
that leads to a room inside the container.

47
00:02:23,821 --> 00:02:29,307
顺序是 IP 地址、host port、container port
The order is IP address, host port, container port:

48
00:02:29,307 --> 00:02:33,179
127.0.0.1，意思是只限这台笔记本
127.0.0.1, meaning this laptop only,

49
00:02:33,179 --> 00:02:36,514
然后是 8090 号门，最后是 9100 号房间
then door 8090, then room 9100.

50
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:41,781
两个 -e 参数告诉 gateway 该去调用哪里
The two -e flags tell the gateway where to call:

51
00:02:41,781 --> 00:02:44,144
名字是 processor，port 是 9200
the name processor, port 9200.

52
00:02:44,464 --> 00:02:47,150
它代码里的第 13 和第 14 行读取这两个值
Lines 13 and 14 of its code read them;

53
00:02:47,150 --> 00:02:50,331
那里引号里的值只是默认值
the values in quotes there are only defaults.

54
00:02:50,567 --> 00:02:52,551
现在对两个分别跑一下 docker logs
Now check docker logs for each.

55
00:02:52,871 --> 00:02:59,634
日志里，processor 监听 9200，只在内部；gateway 监听 9100
The processor listens on 9200, internal only; the gateway listens on 9100.

56
00:02:59,954 --> 00:03:01,554
暂停一下，把两个都启动
Pause and start both.

57
00:03:03,617 --> 00:03:07,493
第 1 步的最后，在浏览器里打开 localhost:8090
To finish step 1, open localhost:8090 in your browser,

58
00:03:07,493 --> 00:03:09,718
输入一条消息，点 Send
type a message, and click Send.

59
00:03:10,038 --> 00:03:15,324
回复是大写的，还带着三个 port 数字：gateway 从哪里发出
The reply comes back in capitals, with three port numbers: where the gateway sent from,

60
00:03:15,324 --> 00:03:19,638
processor 在哪里监听，以及它看到消息是从哪里来的
where the processor listened, and where it saw the message arrive from.

61
00:03:19,884 --> 00:03:25,020
我们录制时没有浏览器，所以用 curl 发了和网页一模一样的请求
We recorded without a browser, so curl sent the same request the page sends;

62
00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:26,710
这是它拿到的回复
this is the reply it got.

63
00:03:27,434 --> 00:03:31,231
这个 processor 监听的是 9200，也就是目的地
The processor listened on 9200, the destination.

64
00:03:31,551 --> 00:03:35,882
但每个连接都有两端，所以 gateway 这一端也需要一个 port
But every connection has two ends, so the gateway's side needs a port too.

65
00:03:36,202 --> 00:03:43,455
它的操作系统挑了一个临时的，55620，把它钉在数据包上
Its operating system picked a temporary one, 55620, and stapled it to the packet.

66
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:46,105
在 processor 那边，看到的是同一个数字
The processor saw the same number arrive,

67
00:03:46,105 --> 00:03:48,863
因为在网络内部没有任何东西会改写它
because nothing rewrites it inside the network.

68
00:03:49,183 --> 00:03:52,486
代码里，gateway 的第 38 行读取自己的 port
Line 38 of the gateway reads its own port;

69
00:03:52,486 --> 00:03:55,946
processor 的第 32 行读取发送方的 port
line 32 of the processor reads the sender's.

70
00:03:56,184 --> 00:04:01,112
再发一次，这个数字就变了：新的连接，新的临时 port
Send again, and the number changes: a new connection, a new temporary port.

71
00:04:01,432 --> 00:04:02,884
你的会不一样
Yours will differ.

72
00:04:02,934 --> 00:04:06,464
还有一个细节：页面上的示意图显示 8090
One more detail: the page's diagram shows 8090

73
00:04:06,464 --> 00:04:08,843
靠的是读取它自己的地址栏
by reading its own address bar.

74
00:04:09,163 --> 00:04:12,513
这个 container 没法知道，你在笔记本上给它开的是哪扇门
The container can't know which door on your laptop you gave it.

75
00:04:12,833 --> 00:04:15,584
暂停一下，发一条消息，两个都别停
Pause, send a message, and leave both running.

76
00:04:16,633 --> 00:04:18,318
第 2 步检查 port
Step 2 checks the ports.

77
00:04:18,638 --> 00:04:25,388
用 docker ps 能看到 gateway 的映射，host 那一侧在前
docker ps shows the gateway's mapping, host side first:

78
00:04:25,388 --> 00:04:29,070
127.0.0.1，port 8090，到 9100
127.0.0.1, port 8090, to 9100.

79
00:04:29,390 --> 00:04:33,934
而 processor 的 PORTS 那一列是空的：在监听，但没有发布
The processor's PORTS column is empty: listening, but not published.

80
00:04:34,183 --> 00:04:38,556
额外跑一个只有三列的 docker ps，和 README 里的示例一致
An extra docker ps with three columns matches the README's sample.

81
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:43,705
那个 127.0.0.1 有什么用？
What does the 127.0.0.1 do?

82
00:04:44,025 --> 00:04:48,633
这次额外的运行把它去掉了，要在所有地址上开 8090 号门
This extra run leaves it out, asking for door 8090 on every address.

83
00:04:48,953 --> 00:04:52,138
Docker 拒绝了，报 port is already allocated
Docker refuses, port is already allocated:

84
00:04:52,138 --> 00:04:53,881
我们的 gateway 占着 8090
our gateway holds 8090.

85
00:04:54,201 --> 00:04:57,038
不过 container 还是创建出来了，所以要把它删掉
The container was still created, so remove it.

86
00:04:57,283 --> 00:05:02,026
用 8091 号门就成功了，映射显示 0.0.0.0
With door 8091 it works, and the mapping shows 0.0.0.0:

87
00:05:02,026 --> 00:05:07,459
所有地址，所以你所在网络里的其他机器也能连进来
every address, so other machines on your network could connect.

88
00:05:07,779 --> 00:05:15,310
把它删掉。所以 README 写的是 127.0.0.1：只限这台笔记本
Remove it. That's why the README writes 127.0.0.1: this laptop only.

89
00:05:15,550 --> 00:05:19,667
在笔记本上，用 curl 访问 8090，返回的是 gateway 的页面
From the laptop, curl on 8090 returns the gateway's page.

90
00:05:19,987 --> 00:05:22,262
用 curl 访问 9200 就连不上
curl on 9200 can't connect:

91
00:05:22,262 --> 00:05:28,328
你的笔记本上没有通向它的门，除非你自己有别的程序在用 9200
your laptop has no door to it, unless something else of yours uses 9200.

92
00:05:28,566 --> 00:05:32,158
用 docker exec 在 gateway 里面运行 curl
From inside the gateway, docker exec runs curl,

93
00:05:32,158 --> 00:05:35,521
按名字 processor 去问 port 9200
asking for the name processor, on port 9200.

94
00:05:35,841 --> 00:05:37,441
回答是：ok
The answer: ok.

95
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:42,208
来想一想。同一条命令，把 processor 换成 localhost
Ponder this. The same command with localhost instead of processor.

96
00:05:42,528 --> 00:05:44,128
谁会回答？
What answers?

97
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:55,556
什么都没有。在 gateway 里面，localhost 就是 gateway 自己
Nothing. Inside the gateway, localhost is the gateway itself,

98
00:05:55,556 --> 00:05:58,187
而它那里没有任何东西在 9200 上监听
and nothing there listens on 9200.

99
00:05:58,507 --> 00:06:00,133
这就是第二个谜题的答案
That's the second puzzle:

100
00:06:00,133 --> 00:06:02,539
每个 container 都有自己的 localhost
each container has its own localhost.

101
00:06:02,859 --> 00:06:06,102
一个额外检查：换成 9100，也就是它自己的 port
An extra check: on 9100, its own port,

102
00:06:06,102 --> 00:06:08,405
localhost 就返回页面
localhost returns the page.

103
00:06:08,650 --> 00:06:10,250
那名字又是怎么起作用的？
So how did the name work?

104
00:06:10,527 --> 00:06:12,061
从 Handy commands 里拿一条
From the handy commands,

105
00:06:12,061 --> 00:06:15,769
docker network inspect 显示每个 container 的地址
docker network inspect shows an address for each container,

106
00:06:15,769 --> 00:06:18,548
都来自 toynet 自己的地址范围，也就是它的子网
from toynet's own address range, its subnet.

107
00:06:19,650 --> 00:06:24,106
每个 container 都去问 Docker 内置的电话簿
Each container asks Docker's built-in phone book,

108
00:06:24,106 --> 00:06:29,015
它在 127.0.0.11，把名字变成这些地址
at 127.0.0.11, which turns names into those addresses.

109
00:06:29,335 --> 00:06:33,026
一个 container 重启时，地址可能会变；名字不会变
Addresses can change when a container restarts; names stay.

110
00:06:33,266 --> 00:06:35,139
再来一条 Handy commands 里的命令
Another handy command,

111
00:06:35,139 --> 00:06:39,310
docker exec -it gateway sh，在里面打开一个 shell
docker exec -it gateway sh, opens a shell inside;

112
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:42,119
它的主机名就是 container ID
its hostname is the container ID.

113
00:06:42,439 --> 00:06:45,279
补充一句：processor 的 image 里其实也有 curl
One aside: the processor image has curl too,

114
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:47,666
虽然 README 暗示它没有
though the README implies it doesn't.

115
00:06:47,986 --> 00:06:50,034
暂停一下，从两边都试一试
Pause, and test from both sides.

116
00:06:51,683 --> 00:06:53,603
第 3 步修改 port
Step 3 changes the ports.

117
00:06:53,923 --> 00:06:56,231
先改临街的门
First the street door:

118
00:06:56,231 --> 00:07:02,840
删掉 gateway，再在 127.0.0.1 的 port 8095 上重新启动它
remove the gateway, and start it again on 127.0.0.1, port 8095.

119
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:05,763
里面的房间还是 9100
The room inside stays 9100.

120
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,283
页面在 8095 上能用
The page works on 8095.

121
00:07:08,603 --> 00:07:11,636
两个额外检查：8090 已经连不上了
Two extra checks: 8090 no longer connects,

122
00:07:11,636 --> 00:07:14,235
docker ps 也显示出新的映射
and docker ps shows the new mapping.

123
00:07:14,555 --> 00:07:16,772
暂停一下，把你的 gateway 的门也挪过去
Pause and move your gateway's door.

124
00:07:19,050 --> 00:07:20,323
为什么要这么做？
Why do this?

125
00:07:20,373 --> 00:07:23,957
你笔记本上可能已经有别的应用占着 8090
Another app on your laptop might already hold 8090.

126
00:07:24,277 --> 00:07:29,311
笔记本上的门必须各不相同；container 里的房间永远不会撞车
Doors on the laptop must be unique; rooms inside containers never collide.

127
00:07:29,550 --> 00:07:34,393
一个小疏漏：gateway 的日志里还是说打开 localhost:8090
A small slip: the gateway's log still says open localhost:8090.

128
00:07:34,713 --> 00:07:37,294
那段文字是写死在第 53 行的
That text is hard-coded in line 53.

129
00:07:37,614 --> 00:07:40,216
要以 docker ps 和页面为准
Trust docker ps and the page instead.

130
00:07:40,466 --> 00:07:42,549
接下来是 processor 的 port
Next, the processor's port:

131
00:07:42,549 --> 00:07:46,098
删掉它，再把 PORT 设为 9300 启动它
remove it, and start it with PORT set to 9300.

132
00:07:46,418 --> 00:07:49,554
README 里说：发一条消息，应该会失败
The README says: send a message, and it should fail.

133
00:07:49,950 --> 00:07:51,550
确实失败了，只是悄无声息
It does, but quietly.

134
00:07:51,763 --> 00:07:55,656
页面没有错误处理，所以上面什么都不会变
The page has no error handling, so nothing on it changes;

135
00:07:55,656 --> 00:07:58,593
我们录下的那次请求只拿到 curl 的报错
the captured request got only curl's error,

136
00:07:58,593 --> 00:08:00,232
Empty reply from server
Empty reply from server.

137
00:08:00,466 --> 00:08:03,985
额外在 gateway 上跑一下 docker logs
An extra docker logs on the gateway shows why:

138
00:08:03,985 --> 00:08:06,356
就知道原因：它通过名字找到了 processor
it found the processor by name,

139
00:08:06,356 --> 00:08:11,175
但连接被拒绝了，已经没有人在 9200 上监听
but the connection was refused: nobody listens on 9200 anymore.

140
00:08:11,495 --> 00:08:16,131
名字写错的话，失败的方式不一样：见练习。来想一想
A wrong name fails differently: see the exercises. Ponder this.

141
00:08:16,451 --> 00:08:20,270
改哪一个设置能修好它，又有没有哪个 image 需要重新构建？
Which one setting fixes it, and does any image need rebuilding?

142
00:08:27,116 --> 00:08:29,200
改 gateway 的 processor port 变量
The gateway's processor port.

143
00:08:29,250 --> 00:08:32,391
删掉 gateway，用 9300 重新启动它
Remove the gateway and start it with 9300,

144
00:08:32,391 --> 00:08:35,607
门也换回 8090，消息就能发过去了
back on 8090, and the message goes through.

145
00:08:35,927 --> 00:08:39,361
没有重新构建任何 image：这只是配置
No image was rebuilt: it's only configuration.

146
00:08:39,681 --> 00:08:41,281
暂停一下，把你的也修好
Pause and fix yours.

147
00:08:42,116 --> 00:08:45,151
两个设置必须一致：processor 的 PORT
The two settings must agree: the processor's PORT

148
00:08:45,151 --> 00:08:47,194
和 gateway 的 processor port
and the gateway's processor port.

149
00:08:47,433 --> 00:08:52,169
最后，用 Compose 之前先清理：删掉两个 container，再删网络
Finally, clean up before Compose: remove both containers, then the network.

150
00:08:52,489 --> 00:08:56,244
一个额外检查显示，只剩下 hello-world 那个旧 container
An extra check shows only hello-world's old container left.

151
00:08:56,564 --> 00:08:59,401
跳过这一步，Compose 就会遇到名字冲突
Skip this, and Compose hits a name conflict.

152
00:08:59,721 --> 00:09:01,321
暂停一下，清理干净
Pause and clean up.

153
00:09:04,317 --> 00:09:07,584
第 4 步：Docker Compose，它根据一个配置文件
Step 4: Docker Compose, which builds and starts the whole app from one YAML file.

154
00:09:07,584 --> 00:09:09,544
把整个应用构建好并启动起来
Step 4: Docker Compose, which builds and starts the whole app from one YAML file.

155
00:09:09,864 --> 00:09:14,344
README 里只给了节选；把完整的 docker-compose.yml 打开
The README shows an excerpt; open the whole docker-compose.yml.

156
00:09:14,664 --> 00:09:18,034
你手动敲过的参数，几乎每一个都能在里面找到位置
Almost every flag you typed by hand has a home in it.

157
00:09:18,284 --> 00:09:22,871
原来的 --name 变成了 container name，构建命令变成了 build
--name becomes container name, and the build command becomes build.

158
00:09:23,191 --> 00:09:24,691
原来的 -p 变成了 ports
-p becomes ports,

159
00:09:24,691 --> 00:09:29,996
-e 变成了 environment，而网络在文件最下面命名
-e becomes environment, and the network is named at the bottom of the file.

160
00:09:31,884 --> 00:09:33,037
有两个键是新的
Two keys are new:

161
00:09:33,037 --> 00:09:36,678
volumes 这个键把 gateway 的目录挂载到 /app
the volumes key mounts the gateway's folder into /app,

162
00:09:36,678 --> 00:09:40,055
depends on 这个键让 processor 先启动
and the depends on key starts the processor first.

163
00:09:40,375 --> 00:09:44,449
整个第 1 步合成了一条命令：docker compose up
All of step 1 collapses into one command: docker compose up.

164
00:09:44,684 --> 00:09:49,127
运行它。Compose 构建了两个 image，全部用了缓存
Run it. Compose builds both images, all from the cache,

165
00:09:49,127 --> 00:09:53,750
并按目录名和服务名给它们命名：port toy 加上 -gateway
and names them after the folder and the service: port_toy-gateway.

166
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,922
然后它创建网络和两个 container
Then it creates the network and both containers,

167
00:09:56,922 --> 00:10:00,635
打印出两个横幅，每一行前面都标着它的服务名
and prints both banners, each line prefixed with its service.

168
00:10:00,955 --> 00:10:02,300
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

169
00:10:02,350 --> 00:10:04,163
打开页面：能用
Open the page: it works.

170
00:10:04,483 --> 00:10:07,608
在第二个终端里，先 cd 进 port toy
In a second terminal, cd into port toy first:

171
00:10:07,608 --> 00:10:10,734
Compose 读的是当前目录里的文件
Compose reads the file in the current folder.

172
00:10:11,054 --> 00:10:14,190
在那里，docker compose ps 显示同样的映射
There, docker compose ps shows the same mapping.

173
00:10:14,434 --> 00:10:18,359
额外的 network ls 显示，toynet 是 Compose 创建的
An extra network ls shows that Compose made toynet,

174
00:10:18,359 --> 00:10:22,284
而 compose exec 按名字连到了 processor，回复 ok
and compose exec reaches the processor by name: ok.

175
00:10:22,650 --> 00:10:24,915
README 的那张表把每条手动敲的命令
The README's table pairs each by-hand command with its Compose version.

176
00:10:24,915 --> 00:10:27,194
和它在 Compose 里的写法一一对应
The README's table pairs each by-hand command with its Compose version.

177
00:10:27,514 --> 00:10:30,821
在第一个终端里，你的请求现在会出现在日志里
In the first terminal, your requests now show in the log.

178
00:10:31,067 --> 00:10:34,188
README 到第 4 步最后才停掉应用
The README stops the app at the end of step 4;

179
00:10:34,188 --> 00:10:37,446
我们现在就在前台停掉它：按 Ctrl-C
we stop it now, in the foreground: press Ctrl+C.

180
00:10:37,766 --> 00:10:41,926
Compose 说它正在优雅地停止，但要花大约 20 秒
Compose says it's stopping gracefully, but it takes about 20 seconds.

181
00:10:45,134 --> 00:10:47,745
作为每个 container 的第一个进程
Python, each container's first process,

182
00:10:47,745 --> 00:10:49,754
Python 会忽略这个礼貌的停止信号
ignores the polite stop signal

183
00:10:49,754 --> 00:10:51,897
除非程序里专门写了捕获它的代码
unless it's written to catch it.

184
00:10:52,217 --> 00:10:55,758
所以 Docker 对每个 container 等 10 秒，然后强行杀掉它
So Docker waits 10 seconds per container, then kills it.

185
00:10:58,667 --> 00:11:01,462
退出码 137 表示被强行杀掉
Exit code 137 means killed.

186
00:11:01,782 --> 00:11:03,459
用 docker compose ps -a 一看
docker compose ps -a:

187
00:11:03,459 --> 00:11:06,880
两个 container 都退出了，但还在那里
both containers exited, but they're still there.

188
00:11:07,117 --> 00:11:10,151
输入 docker compose down
docker compose down removes the containers

189
00:11:10,151 --> 00:11:13,474
它删掉 container 和网络，ps -a 里什么都不剩
and the network, and nothing is left in ps -a.

190
00:11:13,794 --> 00:11:16,120
按 Ctrl-C 是停止；down 才是删除
Ctrl+C stops; down removes.

191
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:18,381
暂停一下，把整个流程跑一遍
Pause, and run the whole cycle.

192
00:11:19,417 --> 00:11:25,198
回到 README 的顺序：up -d 在后台启动应用，把提示符还给你
Back to the README's order: up -d starts the app in the background and returns your prompt.

193
00:11:25,434 --> 00:11:27,189
两条 Handy commands 里的命令
Two handy commands.

194
00:11:27,239 --> 00:11:30,754
用 compose logs -f 持续跟踪 gateway 的日志
docker compose logs -f follows the gateway's log;

195
00:11:30,754 --> 00:11:33,050
按 Ctrl-C 只停止跟踪
Ctrl+C stops only the following.

196
00:11:33,370 --> 00:11:36,771
用 compose exec gateway sh 打开一个 shell
docker compose exec gateway sh opens a shell,

197
00:11:36,771 --> 00:11:40,324
在里面，环境变量显示的是 processor 和 9200
where the environment shows processor and 9200.

198
00:11:41,967 --> 00:11:45,743
接下来，README 里说：在文件里重做一遍 port 实验
Next, the README says to repeat the port experiments in the file.

199
00:11:46,063 --> 00:11:49,364
把 8090 改成 8095，再运行 up -d
Change 8090 to 8095 and run up -d:

200
00:11:49,364 --> 00:11:52,762
Compose 只重新创建 gateway
Compose recreates only the gateway.

201
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:57,331
页面在 8095 上有回应；把它改回去，再让它生效一次
The page answers on 8095; change it back and apply again.

202
00:12:00,184 --> 00:12:02,531
我们在 processor 的代码里加了一行注释
We added a comment to the processor's code.

203
00:12:02,851 --> 00:12:06,797
复制进 image 的代码改了，就要加 --build
Changed code that's copied into an image needs --build.

204
00:12:07,117 --> 00:12:11,362
只有 COPY 那一层是新的，也只有 processor 被重新创建
Only the copy layer is new, and only the processor is recreated.

205
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:13,659
那个 gateway 的目录是挂载进去的
The gateway's folder is mounted,

206
00:12:13,659 --> 00:12:16,041
而且它每次加载都会重新读页面
and it rereads its page on each load:

207
00:12:16,041 --> 00:12:19,195
改动在下次刷新时就能看到，不用重新构建
edits show on the next reload, without a rebuild.

208
00:12:20,050 --> 00:12:24,615
最后，docker compose down；ps -a 里什么都不剩
To finish, docker compose down; nothing is left in ps -a.

209
00:12:24,935 --> 00:12:30,397
这些 image 还在，共用大约 200 MB；删掉它们可以腾出空间
The images remain, sharing about 200 megabytes; remove them to free space.

210
00:12:30,717 --> 00:12:32,328
这个 port toy 一分钱都不花
Port toy costs nothing.

211
00:12:32,530 --> 00:12:34,130
暂停一下，把它关掉
Pause and shut it down.

